repository-code: "https://github.com/causaldyn/mixdyn"
# the concept DOI, which resolves to the newest release rather than to one version
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24425629"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/mixdyn/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.3
date-released: "2026-11-24"
abstract: >-
  A media-mix modelling (MMM) engine in Python and JAX: regressions, discount dynamic linear models,
  Bayesian models with lift and geo tests in the likelihood, geo hierarchies, test readers and budget
  plans, computed without a UI, built on causal-hybrid-control. Its pre-registered runs of the
  causaldyn bench (M3, M4 and M5) state a non-inferiority result with its losses, not a claim to be
  best.
keywords:
  - marketing mix modeling
  - media mix modeling
  - causal inference
  - bayesian inference
  - budget allocation
  - lift tests
  - geo experiments
  - jax
